# Desktop

## Overview
- **Path**: `products/desktop`
- **Tech Stack**: Python 3.11+, Tkinter, Poetry, Pytest
- **Target Platforms**: macOS, Linux, Windows workstations
- **Documentation**: `docs/products/desktop/REQUIREMENTS.md`

## Component Ownership
- `products/desktop/src/photo_selector_toolbox/{core,exif,tools}/, cli.py`: @desktop-backend-agent
- `products/desktop/src/photo_selector_toolbox/gui/`: @desktop-gui-agent
- `products/desktop/tests/, products/desktop/benchmarks/`: @desktop-test-agent
