## Test & Verification Commands
- Primary test: `poetry run pytest products/desktop/tests/unit -m "not visual"`
- CI mirror: `./scripts/run_tests.sh`

## Architectural Invariants
Never update Tkinter widgets from background worker threads. Asynchronous EXIF reading and thumbnail caching via thread pools.
- **Strict Isolation**: Do not import from or copy code to other products.
